## Summary

::summary
Diagnostic medical sonographer with a B.S. in Comprehensive Medical Imaging, Ultrasound concentration (UNLV); ARDMS OB/GYN registry exam scheduled September 2026. Progressed from clinical rotations to a full-time hospital sonographer role within a year, scanning across general, vascular, and OB/GYN specialties in emergency and in-patient settings. Calm under pressure and at ease with patients, backed by four years of customer-facing experience.
::

